# COMPONENT

## AggregateExternalUpdateSample

### PACKAGE

org.sample.aggregateexternalupdate

### DESCRIPTION

Aggregate sample for external update-side semantics.

# SERVICE

## Order

### DESCRIPTION

Order-facing operations for external update semantics.

### OPERATION

#### cancelOrder

##### DESCRIPTION

Cancels an order aggregate and applies follow-up updates to external aggregated members.

##### IN

Aggregate cancellation command.

##### OUT

Updated aggregate projection.

# ENTITY

## Order

### ATTRIBUTE

| name   | type      | multiplicity |
|--------+-----------+--------------|
| id     | entityid  | 1            |
| userId | entityid  | 1            |
| name   | name      | 1            |
| status | string    | 1            |

### AGGREGATE

#### MEMBER

| name           | entity         | kind        | boundary | join    | multiplicity | join_field |
|----------------+----------------+-------------+----------+---------+--------------+------------|
| shipmentOrders | ShipmentOrder  | aggregation | external | reverse | *            | orderId    |
| user           | User           | association | external | direct  | ?            | userId     |

